// gemoji aliases that QuickEmoji does not index as exact shortcodes (the 1000 tier).
// The emoji stay findable through their names and keywords. Each entry is explained in docs/DECISIONS.md.
// DataBuilder fails if an alias listed here no longer exists in gemoji.
{
  // Letter buttons: the alias only repeats the visible text, while the word means something else.
  "🆗": ["ok"],
  "🆒": ["cool"],
  "🆙": ["up"],

  // One specific moon phase; "moon" means 🌙.
  "🌔": ["moon"],

  // American usage; QuickEmoji's English and Bulgarian users mean association football (⚽).
  "🏈": ["football"]
}
